@Biz.Bizadm.ModelRouter.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5174

### 모델 목록 (OpenAI 형식)
GET {{Biz.Bizadm.ModelRouter.Server_HostAddress}}/v1/models
Accept: application/json

### 모델 목록 (Anthropic 형식)
GET {{Biz.Bizadm.ModelRouter.Server_HostAddress}}/v1/models
anthropic-version: 2023-06-01

### OpenAI Chat Completions
POST {{Biz.Bizadm.ModelRouter.Server_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"Bizadm-GPT-6-LUNA","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"안녕하세요"}]}

### Anthropic Messages
POST {{Biz.Bizadm.ModelRouter.Server_HostAddress}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
anthropic-version: 2023-06-01

{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","max_tokens":1024,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"안녕하세요"}]}

### Anthropic Messages → OpenAI 계열 모델 (교차 변환)
POST {{Biz.Bizadm.ModelRouter.Server_HostAddress}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
anthropic-version: 2023-06-01

{"model":"Bizadm-GPT-6-LUNA","max_tokens":1024,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"안녕하세요"}]}

### Anthropic count_tokens
POST {{Biz.Bizadm.ModelRouter.Server_HostAddress}}/v1/messages/count_tokens
Content-Type: application/json
anthropic-version: 2023-06-01

{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"안녕하세요"}]}

